# RECIPES — read, edit, create, recycle bin, import status.
# Set @recipeId first. See README.md for environments and labels.
# Search → 10-search.rest. Reimport → 11-recipe-reimport.rest.
# Regenerate description/hero, reindex → 07-workflow.rest.

@recipeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@image1 = /absolute/path/to/recipe-photo-1.jpg
@image2 = /absolute/path/to/recipe-photo-2.jpg


# ═══ READ ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### READ ONLY — List recipes (page and limit; also accepts name=, url=, order=)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes?page=1&limit=20
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

### READ ONLY — Recipe detail
# servings is null when unknown.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}

### READ ONLY — Library summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/library-summary
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

### READ ONLY — Original photo (index 0, 1, …)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}/original/0
Accept: image/*
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

### READ ONLY — Hero image (404 until generated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}/hero
Accept: image/*
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}


# ═══ EDIT (only the fields you send are changed) ═══════════════════════════

### CHANGES DATA — Notes and rating
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

{
  "notes": "Reduce soy sauce by half next time.",
  "rating": 3
}

### CHANGES DATA — Servings (an integer of 1 or more; null returns 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

{
  "servings": 4
}


# ═══ CREATE (each one starts an AI import) ═════════════════════════════════

### CHANGES DATA + AI — Create a recipe from photos (set @image1/@image2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary123

--Boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="rating"

2
--Boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="finishedDishImageIndex"

0
--Boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="recipe-photo-1.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< {{image1}}
--Boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="recipe-photo-2.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< {{image2}}
--Boundary123--

### CHANGES DATA + AI — Create a recipe from a URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/capture-url
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}

{
  "url": "https://example.com/recipe",
  "notes": "",
  "rating": 3
}


# ═══ RECYCLE BIN ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### READ ONLY — Deleted recipes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/trash
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}

### CHANGES DATA — Move a recipe to the recycle bin (409 if it is planned)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}

### CHANGES DATA — Restore a recipe from the recycle bin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}/restore
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}

### DESTRUCTIVE — Permanently delete a recipe that is in the recycle bin
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}/purge
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}


# ═══ IMPORT STATUS ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### READ ONLY — Import pipeline summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/import-status
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}

### READ ONLY — Synthesis status for one recipe ("pending" or "ready")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}/status
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

### START + AI — Import EVERY recipe that has not been imported
# Starts one AI import per unimported recipe. Check import-status first.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/imports/bulk
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
